### 5. DOCUMENTS — RUSTFS PRESIGNED WRITE-ONCE e-CMR VE e-POD (S5-05)
# Uygulama dosya baytlarına hiç dokunmaz; istemci doğrudan localhost:9000'a PUT eder.
################################################################################

### 5.1 e-CMR yükleme linki al (Transportation imzalar)
POST {{edge}}/api/v1/tms/shipments/{{flowShipmentId}}/ecmr/upload-link
Authorization: Bearer {{euToken}}

> {%
    client.test("e-CMR upload link issued", () => client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200"));
    client.global.set("ecmrUploadUrl", response.body.url);
%}

### 5.2 e-CMR PDF'ini doğrudan RustFS'e (localhost:9000) yükle (If-None-Match: * zorunlu)
PUT {{ecmrUploadUrl}}
Content-Type: application/pdf
If-None-Match: *

%PDF-1.4
% FF Logistic e-CMR for {{flowShipmentNumber}}
%%EOF

> {%
    client.test("e-CMR uploaded to RustFS", () => client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200"));
%}

### 5.3 Write-once testi: aynı e-CMR için tekrar upload-link iste -> 409 Conflict beklenir
POST {{edge}}/api/v1/tms/shipments/{{flowShipmentId}}/ecmr/upload-link
Authorization: Bearer {{euToken}}

> {%
    client.test("Second e-CMR upload-link refused with 409", () => client.assert(response.status === 409, "Expected 409"));
%}

